    "detailed_description": "Culinarium is a Card management cooking game where you can cook by stacking ingredients and employees on top of various kitchen tools.<br>You can think about it as Stacklands meeting Overcooked.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/be2a53096cb599352f5a99f30f0ecd88.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/be2a53096cb599352f5a99f30f0ecd88.webm?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/be2a53096cb599352f5a99f30f0ecd88.mp4?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/f3bad557d4468caa9ae9db5130c5264e.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/f3bad557d4468caa9ae9db5130c5264e.webm?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/f3bad557d4468caa9ae9db5130c5264e.mp4?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You open booster packs to get cards that you can then stack to make various dishes that you'll sell. With money you can buy more booster packs and unlock new ingredients, kitchen tools, and recipes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/fff6d8688c1f26fd80cb4fafe37474ba.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/fff6d8688c1f26fd80cb4fafe37474ba.webm?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/fff6d8688c1f26fd80cb4fafe37474ba.mp4?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You'll have to deal with random events from time to time like a rat trying to eat your ingredients, a fire, or a complicated food critic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/0ccc4f6f2bbe17ca0118568d475ec8e0.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/0ccc4f6f2bbe17ca0118568d475ec8e0.webm?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/0ccc4f6f2bbe17ca0118568d475ec8e0.mp4?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are 2 game modes: <br>- An Adventure mode where you have to cook your way up across 4 Acts ( Italy, US, Japan and France ) to become the best chef. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/c18d019332ad616d775568656973ec78.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/c18d019332ad616d775568656973ec78.webm?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/c18d019332ad616d775568656973ec78.mp4?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- A free mode where you can cook the way you want.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/31ad08dfe484b0cba09ec05bfa25940d.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/31ad08dfe484b0cba09ec05bfa25940d.webm?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/31ad08dfe484b0cba09ec05bfa25940d.mp4?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Culinarium is a Card management cooking game where you can cook by stacking ingredients and employees on top of various kitchen tools.<br>You can think about it as Stacklands meeting Overcooked.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/be2a53096cb599352f5a99f30f0ecd88.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/be2a53096cb599352f5a99f30f0ecd88.webm?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/be2a53096cb599352f5a99f30f0ecd88.mp4?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/f3bad557d4468caa9ae9db5130c5264e.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/f3bad557d4468caa9ae9db5130c5264e.webm?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/f3bad557d4468caa9ae9db5130c5264e.mp4?t=1742721561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You open booster packs to get cards that you can then stack to make various dishes that you'll sell. With money you can buy more booster packs and unlock new ingredients, kitchen tools, and recipes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183870/extras/fff6d8688c1f26fd80cb4fafe37474ba.poster.avif?t=1742721561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i